#. Mid tone: item picked
#. Translators: Spoken when the 'move favourite' keyboard command (comma) is pressed the first time on a station, picking it up for reordering; %s is the station name. Press comma again elsewhere in the list to drop it there.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:3894
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s selected. Navigate to the target position and press comma again to drop."
msgstr "%s បានជ្រើសរើសរួចហើយ។ រុករកទីតាំងគោលដៅ ហើយចុច comma ម្តងទៀតដើម្បីរក្សាទុក។"

#. Low tone: cancelled
#. Translators: Spoken if the move-in-progress is cancelled (e.g. Escape) before a drop position is chosen.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:3901
msgid "Move cancelled"
msgstr "ការផ្លាស់ទីត្រូវបានលុបចោល"

#. High tone: successfully moved
#. Translators: Spoken after successfully reordering a favourite station; %s is the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:3937
#, python-format
msgid "Moved: %s"
msgstr "បានផ្លាស់ទី: %s"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:4127
msgid "Stop time (HH:MM):"
msgstr "បញ្ឈប់ពេលវេលា (HH:MM):"

#. Translators: Internal marker value distinguishing a sleep-timer entry from an alarm entry in the timer list; not itself user-visible (the visible strings are built separately below).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:4171
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\timerManager.py:47
msgid "Sleep timer"
msgstr "កម្មវិធីកំណត់ម៉ោងផ្អាក"

#. Translators: One line of the pending-timers list for an alarm (start-radio) timer; %(time)s is the HH:MM time, %(station)s the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:4174
#, python-format
msgid "Alarm %(time)s — %(station)s"
msgstr "សំឡេងរោទិ៍ %(time)s — %(station)s"

#. Translators: One line of the pending-timers list for a sleep (stop-radio) timer; %(time)s is the HH:MM time.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:4179
#, python-format
msgid "Sleep %(time)s"
msgstr "ផ្អាក %(time)s"

#. Translators: Spoken when adding a timer but the timer subsystem failed to initialise.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:4221
msgid "Timer manager is not available"
msgstr "កម្មវិធីគ្រប់គ្រងកម្មវិធីកំណត់ម៉ោងមិនដំណើរការទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken when trying to add a timer at a time that already has one (alarm or sleep) scheduled; %(time)s is the HH:MM time, %(label)s a short description of the conflicting timer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:4256
